        "shortName": "Talon",
        "name": "Underslung Grenade Launcher",
        "description": "The \"Talon\" US military grenade launcher is known to propel enemies into the waiting claws of death.",
        "bobbyRayName": "Talon Underslung Grenade Launcher",
        "bobbyRayDescription": "Developed by the US military, this launcher can be attached to a wide range of assault rifles and machine guns. It comes equipped with a light folding stock and a special pistol grip stock, allowing it to be fired like a pistol. It is considered to be a good entry weapon."
